crates/michi-core/CHANGELOG.md:91:  - **Breaking (paths):** the crate root re-exports `resilience` and `truncate` items by explicit list instead of `pub use resilience::*` and `pub use truncate::*`. Every path that worked before still works (`michi_core::RetryConfig`, `michi_core::already_done`, `michi_core::truncate`, …); items added to those modules later appear only under their module.
crates/michi-core/CHANGELOG.md:145:- Every agent-facing block is now a TOON 4.4 document, not only lists, and no block ends with a newline. `render_hints`, `append_hints`, `render_kv`, `render_recovery`, `append_recovery`, `DomainError::render`, `Error::render`, `StatusResponse::render`, `PartialSuccess::render` and `render_already_done` return a finished document; `append_hints`/`append_recovery` add one LF before the block unless the buffer is empty or already ends in one. Code that concatenated blocks relying on the trailing newline must join them with `\n` or use the append helpers.
